msgid ""
"Delete old backups now, keeping only the most recent ones. Old backups are "
"normally purged automatically when a backup finishes, but if the destination"
" filesystem fills up that step never runs - use this to reclaim space on "
"demand. For borg the repository is pruned and compacted; for "
"dd/ddfull/fsarchiver the oldest dated backup files are deleted. The rsync "
"method keeps a single mirror, so there is nothing to purge."
